          {
            "typeName": "accessToSources",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "*********************************************************************************\r\nData repository contains EBSD and AFM experimental data and their analysis\r\npresented in the paper:\r\nN.R. Lutjes et.al: Spherulitic and rotational crystal growth of Quartz thin films,\r\nScientific Reports, (2021))\r\n*********************************************************************************\r\n\r\nDirectories in data repository are structured according Figures in publication.\r\n\r\nSoftware packages used to generate and analyze research data:\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------\r\nOIM DC v7.3           Orientation Imaging Microscopy data collection by EDAX Inc.\r\nOIM Analysis v8.1     Orientation Imaging Microscopy data analysis by EDAX Inc.\r\nMATLAB R2020b         Programming and numeric platform to analyze data by MathWorks\r\nMTEX v5.5.0           A free Matlab toolbox for analyzing EBSD data: https://mtex-toolbox.github.io/\r\nGwyddion v2.58        A free SPM data visualization and analysis tool: http://gwyddion.net\r\nOrigin v7.5           Data analysis and graphing software by OriginLab Co.\r\n\r\n\r\nFiles types in repository:\r\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\r\nreadme_first.txt    Text description of files present in each directory\r\n           *.txt    ASCII data file\r\n           *.osc    EBSD data collected by OIM DC v.7.3\r\n           *.oim    EBSD data project file created by OIM Analysis v8.1\r\n           *.ang    EBSD data file (ASCII) exported from OIM Analysis v8.1\r\n           *.opj    Origin 7.5 project\r\n           *.m      Text file with Matlab code written for MTEX extension"
          }
        ]
